+## 2026-07-19 — PS-03D5-5-F1 Approved and Closed
+
+PS-03D5-5-F1 — Account Delete Fail-Closed Correction is approved and closed after Command Center source review.
+
+### Final canonical Delete contract
+
+- Public production `DELETE /api/accounts/{accountId}` remains runtime-disabled and returns HTTP 403 with:
+  - `error`: `Account operations are currently disabled`
+  - `code`: `ACCOUNT_OPS_DISABLED`
+- The real `deleteAccountHandler` remains unmounted in the production router.
+- For every valid existing Account, the isolated internal handler returns HTTP 409 with:
+  - `error`: `Account deletion is not available until authoritative assignment history is implemented`
+  - `code`: `ACCOUNT_DELETE_NOT_AVAILABLE`
+- Invalid UUID requests retain the existing 400 contract.
+- Missing or already-deleted Accounts retain the existing 404 contract.
+- No current Delete path hard-deletes or mutates Accounts, Capacities, Backup Codes, identifiers, Games, or `capacity_customers`.
+- The current `capacity_customers` table is not authoritative Assignment History. Its rows may prove historical usage, but the absence of rows cannot authorize deletion.
+
+### Closure status
+
+- PS-03D5-5-F1 is `APPROVED_AND_CLOSED`.
+- PS-03D5-5 is `APPROVED_AND_CLOSED_AFTER_FAIL_CLOSED_CORRECTION`.
+- PS-03D5 remains open.
+- The next authorized sub-stage is PS-03D5-6 — Account Write Frontend, Runtime Disabled, awaiting Command Center authorization to start.
+- PS-03D5-6 was not started as part of this closure.
+
+### Scope boundaries preserved
+
+- Hard Delete will be reconsidered only in a future Orders / Assignment phase after canonical Order, OrderItem, FulfillmentUnit, Assignment, Assignment History, migration, historical-data, permission, and audit contracts are approved.
+- Authentication, Admin Levels, RBAC, Permission, Audit Log, runtime mutation activation, Secret Reveal, and authorized Backup Code reveal remain outside PS-03 in a future Security phase.
+- No speculative phase number is assigned to future Security or Orders / Assignment work.
+
+### Required work before future mutation activation
+
+- Online ID case-preservation and case-insensitive advisory-lock normalization.
+- Server-side error-log redaction for database parameters and sensitive internal details.
+
